sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as Browser shop
    participant API as Axum catalogue routes
    participant Store as Persistence catalogue queries
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    par Load products
        Browser->>API: GET /api/v1/products?limit=100&offset=0
        API->>API: Validate bounded pagination
        alt Invalid query parameters
            API-->>Browser: 400 invalid_pagination
        else Valid page
            API->>Store: list_active_products(limit, offset)
            Store->>DB: Select active products ordered by SKU and ID
            alt Database query succeeds
                DB-->>Store: Product rows
                Store-->>API: Product records
                API-->>Browser: 200 JSON product page
            else Database query fails
                DB-->>Store: SQLx error
                Store-->>API: Persistence error
                API-->>Browser: 503 database_unavailable
            end
        end
    and Load customers
        Browser->>API: GET /api/v1/customers?limit=100&offset=0
        API->>API: Validate bounded pagination
        alt Invalid query parameters
            API-->>Browser: 400 invalid_pagination
        else Valid page
            API->>Store: list_customers(limit, offset)
            Store->>DB: Select customers ordered by name and ID
            DB-->>Store: Customer rows
            Store-->>API: Customer records
            API-->>Browser: 200 JSON customer page
        end
    end
